# Uses of Java APIs that Android API level 26 (android-minSdk) lacks, in the libraries behind kcoap's jvm
# artifacts, each triaged as safe in samples/android-consumer/README.md ("API level findings"): R8 drops
# it, kcoap never reaches it, or the library guards it at runtime. checkAndroidApiDependencies, part of
# check, fails on a use that is not listed here, so a library update cannot add one unseen.
#
# One use per line, as the task prints it: the jar without its version, the class file, the use. Before
# adding a line, triage the use and record it in that table. Remove lines that no longer appear.

